concept:australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-costs-protection-act-2024-sch-1-sec-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 Section 46PSA"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-3 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the section, substitute: 46PSA  Costs Scope (1) This section applies to proceedings (including an appeal) in a court that relate to an application made by a person (the applicant) under section 46PO in respect of one or more respondents to a terminated complaint. When respondent liable for costs (2) Subject to subsection (4), if the applicant is successful in proceedings on one or more grounds, the court must order each respondent against whom the applicant is successful to pay the applicant’s costs. (3) The court may order that the costs to be paid by the respondent be assessed on an indemnity basis or otherwise. (4) If the court is satisfied that the applicant’s unreasonable act or omission caused the applicant to incur costs, the court is not required to order the respondent to pay the costs incurred as a result of that act or omission.  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the section, substitute: 46PSA  Costs Scope (1) This section applies to proceedings (including an appeal) in a court that relate to an application made by a person (the applicant) under section 46PO in respect of one or more respondents to a terminated complaint. When respondent liable for costs (2) Subject to subsection (4), if the applicant is successful in proceedings on one or more grounds, the court must order each respondent against whom the applicant is successful to pay the applicant’s costs. (3) The court may order that the costs to be paid by the respondent be assessed on an indemnity basis or otherwise. (4) If the court is satisfied that the applicant’s unreasonable act or omission caused the applicant to incur costs, the court is not required to order the respondent to pay the costs incurred as a result of that act or omission.  Schedule 1  Amendments"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "02a266a6007e8cf1f71035d93ecb72d49f0ae1c8bc2061a3bc400c59b55d8db7" ;
    cof:pageNumber "7"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-costs-protection-act-2024-sch-1-sec-3-ss-1 ;
