concept:australian-human-rights-commission-amendment-costs-protection-act-2024-sch-1-sec-3-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3(4) Section 46PSA"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-3-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If the court is satisfied that the applicant’s unreasonable act or omission caused the applicant to incur costs, the court is not required to order the respondent to pay the costs incurred as a result of that act or omission.  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    skos:definition "(4) If the court is satisfied that the applicant’s unreasonable act or omission caused the applicant to incur costs, the court is not required to order the respondent to pay the costs incurred as a result of that act or omission.  Schedule 1  Amendments"@en ;
